, 34, 34);\">sleepofmind</span><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; font-family: 'Sarabun Light'; color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">, #</span><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; font-family: 'Sarabun Light'; color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">sleepofmindparnter</span><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; font-family: 'Sarabun Light'; color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">, and @</span><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; font-family: 'Sarabun Light'; color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">sleepofmind.co</span><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; font-family: 'Sarabun Light'; color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\"> (insta)/ @</span><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; font-family: 'Sarabun Light'; color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">sleepofmind</span><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; font-family: 'Sarabun Light'; color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\"> (other socials) are included in ALL content pieces.</span></div>\r\n<p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: 0in; white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; margin: 0pt 0in; text-align: left; direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: embed; word-break: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt; font-family: 'Sarabun Medium'; color: rgb(43, 43, 43);\">Campaign Description</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: 0in; white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0in; text-align: left; direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: embed; word-break: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'Sarabun Light'; color: rgb(43, 43, 43);\">We believe every parent deserves the peace of mind that comes from knowing their baby is sleeping safely. Through this partnership, we aim to inspire your audience to discover how Sleep of Mind&rsquo;s products can support anxiety free, restful sleep for both baby and parents, at an affordable price.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: 0in; white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0in; text-align: left; direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: embed; word-break: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'Sarabun Light'; color: rgb(43, 43, 43);\"></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: 0in; white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0in; text-align: left; direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: embed; word-break: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'Sarabun Light'; color: rgb(43, 43, 43);\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt; font-family: 'Sarabun Medium'; color: rgb(43, 43, 43);\">Product Description</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; line-height: 18.4px; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0.18in; text-align: left; direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: embed; word-break: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'Sarabun Medium'; color: black;\">Our product is unique, in that there is an educational component to it that must be understood before someone can get behind it.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; line-height: 18.4px; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0.18in; text-align: left; direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: embed; word-break: normal;\"></p>\r\n<p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; line-height: 18.4px; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0.18in; text-align: left; direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: embed; word-break: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'Sarabun Medium'; color: black;\">Due to the popularity of home apnea monitors (Owlet, </span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'Sarabun Medium'; color: black;\">Nanit</span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'Sarabun Medium'; color: black;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'Sarabun Medium'; color: black;\">etc</span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'Sarabun Medium'; color: black;\">), many consumers assume there is some form of electrical component or </span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'Sarabun Medium'; color: black;\">battery operated</span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'Sarabun Medium'; color: black;\"> connectivity with our product. </span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'Sarabun Medium'; color: black;\">So</span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'Sarabun Medium'; color: black;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'Sarabun Medium'; color: black;\">its</span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'Sarabun Medium'; color: black;\"> important to make sure your creative explains that these sleep sacks and swaddles work without the use of batteries, wires, electronics or Bluetooth. </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; line-height: 18.4px; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0.18in; text-align: left; direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: embed; word-break: normal;\"></p>\r\n<p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; line-height: 18.4px; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0.18in; text-align: left; direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: embed; word-break: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'Sarabun Medium'; color: black;\">We also find that some new parents who have yet to see their baby sleep independently may not understand the anxiety one feels when watching their baby sleep on the baby monitor. </span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'Sarabun Medium'; color: black;\">So</span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'Sarabun Medium'; color: black;\"> we&rsquo;ve seen how important it is to paint that anxiety ridden picture. Those parents who get it, will empathise, and those who don&rsquo;t, may begin to understand the value our sleepwear holds.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; line-height: 18.4px; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0.18in; text-align: left; direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: embed; word-break: normal;\"></p>\r\n<p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; line-height: 18.4px; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0.18in; text-align: left; direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: embed; word-break: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'Sarabun Medium'; color: black;\">Affordability is also a key feature, as an Owlet or </span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'Sarabun Medium'; color: black;\">Nanit</span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'Sarabun Medium'; color: black;\"> aren&rsquo;t in everyone&rsquo;s price range, so it&rsquo;s important to us that consumers appreciate the affordability of our sleepwear, in being a more accurate provider of breathing and more </span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'Sarabun Medium'; color: black;\">cost effective</span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'Sarabun Medium'; color: black;\"> solution as well.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'Sarabun Light'; color: rgb(43, 43, 43);\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt; font-family: 'Sarabun Medium'; color: rgb(43, 43, 43);\">Content Guide</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; line-height: 18.4px; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0.18in; text-align: left; direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: embed; word-break: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; font-family: 'Sarabun Light'; color: black;\">Main benefits (include as many as possible)</span></p>\r\n<div style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; line-height: 18.4px; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 1in; text-indent: -0.32in; text-align: left; direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: embed; word-break: normal;\" class=\"O1\"><span style=\"font-size: 9pt;\"><span style=\"color: black; font-family: 'Courier New'; font-size: 10pt;\">o</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; font-family: 'Sarabun Light'; color: black;\">Sleep of Mind swaddles and sleep sacks help decrease </span><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; font-family: 'Sarabun Light'; color: black;\">anxiety</span><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; font-family: 'Sarabun Light'; color: black;\"> so families can get more sleep</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; line-height: 18.4px; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 1in; text-indent: -0.32in; text-align: left; direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: embed; word-break: normal;\" class=\"O1\"><span style=\"font-size: 9pt;\"><span style=\"color: black; font-family: 'Courier New'; font-size: 10pt;\">o</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; font-family: 'Sarabun Light'; color: black;\">Patent pending reflective design helps show infant&rsquo;s torso rising and falling with each breath</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; line-height: 18.4px; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 1in; text-indent: -0.32in; text-align: left; direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: embed; word-break: normal;\" class=\"O1\"><span style=\"font-size: 9pt;\"><span style=\"color: black; font-family: 'Courier New'; font-size: 10pt;\">o</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; font-family: 'Sarabun Light'; color: black;\">No </span><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; font-family: 'Sarabun Light'; color: black;\">more</span><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; font-family: 'Sarabun Light'; color: black;\"> need to check if your baby is breathing, you can just glance at the monitor any time to see for yourself. This helps baby get more sleep and helps you avoid staring at the monitor for long periods, making it easier for you to get more sleep</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; line-height: 18.4px; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 1in; text-indent: -0.32in; text-align: left; direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: embed; word-break: normal;\" class=\"O1\"><span style=\"font-size: 9pt;\"><span style=\"color: black; font-family: 'Courier New'; font-size: 10pt;\">o</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; font-family: 'Sarabun Light'; color: black;\">No batteries, Bluetooth, wires or need for expensive gadgets. It works with your night vision baby monitor</span></div>\r\n<p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; line-height: 18.4px; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0.68in; text-align: left; direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: embed; word-break: normal;\"></p>\r\n<p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; line-height: 18.4px; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0.18in; text-align: left; direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: embed; word-break: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; font-family: 'Sarabun Light'; color: black;\">Content Ideas:</span></p>\r\n<div style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; line-height: 18.4px; margin: 0pt 0.17in 0pt 1in; text-indent: -0.31in; text-align: left; direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: embed; word-break: normal;\" class=\"O1\"><span style=\"font-size: 9pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-family: 'Sarabun Light'; font-size: 9pt;\">○</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; font-family: 'Sarabun Light'; color: black;\">Product review/ testimonial (Example hook: &ldquo;This sleep sack literally changed my life&rdquo;)</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; line-height: 18.4px; margin: 0pt 0.17in 0pt 1in; text-indent: -0.31in; text-align: left; direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: embed; word-break: normal;\" class=\"O1\"><span style=\"font-size: 9pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-family: 'Sarabun Light'; font-size: 9pt;\">○</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; font-family: 'Sarabun Light'; color: black;\">Talk about the anxiety you felt as a parent with your baby breathing during sleep and show how Sleep of Mind works (Example hook: &ldquo;My anxiety went from 10 to 1 instantly in one night&rdquo;)</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; line-height: 18.4px; margin: 0pt 0.17in 0pt 1in; text-indent: -0.31in; text-align: left; direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: embed; word-break: normal;\" class=\"O1\"><span style=\"font-size: 9pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-family: 'Sarabun Light'; font-size: 9pt;\">○</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; font-family: 'Sarabun Light'; color: black;\">Before / after videos (Example hook: &ldquo;This was me before&hellip;&rdquo;)</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; line-height: 18.4px; margin: 0pt 0.17in 0pt 1in; text-indent: -0.31in; text-align: left; direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: embed; word-break: normal;\" class=\"O1\"><span style=\"font-size: 9pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-family: 'Sarabun Light'; font-size: 9pt;\">○</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; font-family: 'Sarabun Light'; color: black;\">Day in the life of videos (Example hook: &ldquo;This is how I get my baby to sleep through the night&rdquo;)</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; line-height: 18.4px; margin: 0pt 0.17in 0pt 1in; text-indent: -0.31in; text-align: left; direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: embed; word-break: normal;\" class=\"O1\"><span style=\"font-size: 9pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-family: 'Sarabun Light'; font-size: 9pt;\">○</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; font-family: 'Sarabun Light'; color: black;\">Most used baby products list inclusion (Example hook: &ldquo;Don&rsquo;t buy anything for sleep except these 3 things&rdquo;)</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; line-height: 18.4px; margin: 0pt 0.17in 0pt 1in; text-indent: -0.31in; text-align: left; direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: embed; word-break: normal;\" class=\"O1\"><span style=\"white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; font-size: 9pt; font-family: 'Sarabun Light'; color: black;\">Top products for sleep list inclusion (Example hook: &ldquo;My top 5 things for babies under 1 year&rdquo;)</span></div>\r\n<p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; line-height: 18.4px; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0.19in; text-align: left; direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: embed; word-break: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; font-family: 'Sarabun Light'; color: black;\">Mandatories:</span></p>\r\n<div style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; line-height: 18.4px; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 1in; text-indent: -0.31in; text-align: left; direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: embed; word-break: normal;\" class=\"O1\"><span style=\"font-size: 9pt;\"><span style=\"color: black; font-family: 'Sarabun Light'; font-size: 9pt;\">○</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; font-family: 'Sarabun Light'; color: black;\">Must show how the swaddle or sleep sack performs on a baby when sleeping (can use your own footage or ours but please make sure you follow all instructions the sleepwear comes with if you film your own footage)</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; line-height: 18.4px; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 1in; text-indent: -0.31in; text-align: left; direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: embed; word-break: normal;\" class=\"O1\"><span style=\"font-size: 9pt;\"><span style=\"color: black; font-family: 'Sarabun Light'; font-size: 9pt;\">○</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; font-family: 'Sarabun Light'; color: black;\">Tag</span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; font-family: 'Sarabun Light'; color: rgb(26, 179, 159);\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/sleepofmind.co/\" rel=\"noopener\"> @sleepofmind.co </a></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; font-family: 'Sarabun Light'; color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">(Instagram)&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; font-family: 'Sarabun Light'; color: black;\">and @</span><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; font-family: 'Sarabun Light'; color: black;\">sleepofmind</span><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; font-family: 'Sarabun Light'; color: black;\"> (all other platforms)</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; line-height: 18.4px; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 1in; text-indent: -0.31in; text-align: left; direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: embed; word-break: normal;\" class=\"O1\"><span style=\"font-size: 9pt;\"><span style=\"color: black; font-family: 'Sarabun Light'; font-size: 9pt;\">○</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; font-family: 'Sarabun Light'; color: black;\">May use the hashtags #ad #</span><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; font-family: 'Sarabun Light'; color: black;\">sleepofmind</span><span style=\"font-s